<title>USA: Video Update overallotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Video Update overallotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Update Inc said Wednesday that investment banking firms Piper Jaffray Inc and Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc exercised their overallotment option to buy 915,000 shares of the company's Class A common stock.</p>
<p>On October 2 Video Update said it completed a 6.1 million share offering of its Class A common stock.</p>
<p>Video Update owns, operates and franchises video specialty stores under the Video Update name in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
